atDirectives.description:
Define your design tokens (colors, fonts, breakpoints, spacing) as CSS variables. Tailwind generates utility classes from them.
```css
@theme {
  --font-sans: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
}
```

Apply a Tailwind variant to styles in your own CSS.
```css
.btn {
  background: white;
  @variant dark {
    background: black;
  }
}
```
